Package: EcoNicheOpt
Title: R Interface to the EcoNiche-Opt Immune Response Model
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: c(person("EcoNiche-Opt", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com"))
Description: Provides a lightweight R interface to the Python EcoNiche-Opt package for immune checkpoint blockade response modeling. The wrapper exposes model fitting, scoring, feature coverage, module tables, and serialization through reticulate.
